<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan March consumer prices at 11.82 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan March consumer prices at 11.82 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's consumer price index was at 11.82 percent in March year-on-year compared with 13.83 percent in February and 10.27 percent in March 1996, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as a base year, fell 0.45 percent in March to 193.33 from 194.20 in February. The index stood at 172.90 in March 1996.</p>
<p>					  March	Feb	March 1996</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE  base 1990/91   193.33    194.20	 172.90</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  -0.45     +1.09	 +1.35</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +11.82    +13.83	 +10.27</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
